<title>RUSSIA: TENNIS-ST PETERSBURG OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ST PETERSBURG OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ST PETERSBURG, Russia 1997-03-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results at the $300,000 St Petersburg Open men's tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>5-Thomas Johansson (Sweden) beat 1-Michael Stich (Germany) 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>7-Renzo Furlan (Italy) beat Jan Kroslak (Slovakia) 6-3  6-3</p>
</text>
